/-!
# U5 zero-slice matter action read

The fixed P506/L0 first whole-action sweep already carries the ambient
matter first jet generated by its source-owned temporal leg.  This module
identifies the canonical-time derivative on every point of the zero slice
with that exact generated profile velocity.

The result is a readout of the existing `U5` field.  It does not accept a
residual, target derivative, branch, or equation receipt and does not create
a successor.
-/

